  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASTRA - Core support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Kvinnna till Kvinna Foundation&#x2019;s regional programme &quot;Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents&quot; the partner organisation ASTRA is recieving core support. With the core  funding ASTRA is aiming at contributing to the following project outcomes:
- WROs, LGBT+ organisations and feminist movements have resources and capacity to deliver crucial core services, and support to empower and mobilize vulnerable women / LGBT+ persons.  
- WROs, LGBT+ organisations and feminist movements have resources to adapt to closing civic space and act to hold government / other stakeholders accountable on GBV and HR commitments.
- WROs, LGBT+ organisations and feminist movements demonstrate increased resilience (through increased knowledge, integrated security measures, networks and resources) to counter the anti-democratic movements and GBV.</narrative>
  </description>
